# The build produces this (tools/build_ui.sh, driven by comshu-ui/CMakeLists),
# so it is ignored like any other build output. It was briefly committed, to
# make the spack +ui variant possible before the build could build it itself;
# that cost new blobs on every frontend change, since Vite's hashed names never
# dedupe. package-lock.json IS tracked — a lockfile is source, not output.
dist/
